        <mxCell id="c36" value="&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt; The circle: a ledger row has at most one cost center and may have none. 115,623 of 815,921 ledger rows have a blank CostCenterID, mostly on balance sheet accounts, so a report by cost center leaves them out. Every Budget row names a cost center." style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF5E7;strokeColor=#FEF5E7;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="530" width="860" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
