        <mxCell id="c50" value="&lt;i&gt;Month in Budget and FiscalPeriod in GLEntry hold the same month number under two names. To compare the two, sum the ledger to the four columns after leaving out the year-end close entries, then set it beside BudgetAmount.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="614" width="860" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
